Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《政党恩惠》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在呐喊你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}They roar your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.33,0:00:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不了多久 他们也会呐喊你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon they shall roar yours as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你心不在焉的话 大概就只能赚到哀嚎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or mourn it, if your mind is absent the task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.63,0:00:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妻儿至今下落不明…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm yet to have word on my wife and son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.30,0:00:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not fight alongside a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄不清自己目标的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is not clear to his purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.83,0:00:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:00:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的目标是血流成河\N{\fnArial\fs30}My purpose is blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,举盾！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shield!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.76,0:01:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 太棒了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管搭档是个不入流的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even chained to an inferior gladiator, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯仍战无不胜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus prevails!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.73,0:01:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚冠军的身上 从来不乏惊奇之事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}One would expect no less from the Champion of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.50,0:02:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,且看他如何让民众沸腾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how he ignites the crowd!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.46,0:02:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现身于贵公子生日会一事\N{\fnArial\fs30}His presence at your son's birthday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,将成为共和国的美谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be the talk of the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.26,0:02:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和我15岁时有天壤之别\N{\fnArial\fs30}A far cry from my own fifteenth year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.13,0:02:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上成人礼袍 我便成人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I put on the Toga Virilis and passed into manhood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.43,0:02:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,仪式虽然正式 却沉闷无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was a stuffy, formal ceremony{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,乏味得像是巫婆和亡灵的对谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}ridden with corpses and hags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.43,0:02:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲自称是个演说家\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father deemed himself an orator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,却说得宾客昏昏欲睡 有些人甚至睡死了过去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lulled our guests to slumber, some never to awaken!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对Numerius 我们绝不能如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would not have it so for Numerius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吵着要你手下最好的两个角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been clamoring for a pair of your finest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的成人礼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to battle in exhibition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来场精彩对决\N{\fnArial\fs30}at his celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.53,0:02:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定得满足他这个心愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well we would see him well satisfied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 也得令他尊贵的父亲满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by extension his noble father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.73,0:02:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果您能在鄙陋室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though thought strikes if you hold the celebration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,举办这场庆典\N{\fnArial\fs30}beneath my humble roof, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 贵公子就能近观我旗下每一个角斗士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then your boy can bear close witness to all my gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗 父亲？拜托了？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we, Father? Please?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做 要多花多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the extra cost for such generosity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友之间 举手之劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}A favor between friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是感激不尽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Received with much gratitude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 下一个就轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're next Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.46,0:03:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这儿来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定 这不会不合适吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you certain it won't cause imposition?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place it from your thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,成人礼一生只有一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boy becomes a man but once in his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他有什么愿望 都应该得到满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should be richly indulged in his interests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对角斗赛百看不厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never ceases to tire of the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于鲜血和竞技\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's of the same obsessive ilk as Ilithyia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.53,0:03:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和Ilithyia是同一类人\N{\fnArial\fs30}regarding blood and sport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的缺席倒令人惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her absence comes as surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.43,0:03:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫非她一声不响地 已经回罗马去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has she returned to Rome, absent farewells?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她觉得… 不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has been feeling… unwell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不会太严重吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing serious, I hope?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是胃不舒服 静养下就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will pass, as all things born of a weak stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的战袍让我们无从下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}His armor gives pause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们应该攻击高位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we shall aim higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过这么精彩的一幕！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen anything like it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着精力 来日再战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live to fight another day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到别人冠着你的称号 真让我难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It pains me to watch others claim your laurels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你一直站在我旁边 你会更难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your pain shall increase if you continue to stand beside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well done brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.66,0:06:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天状态不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fought well today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙天神眷顾 有你这么个搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods favored me, to count you as ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的眷顾 可不光局限在竞技场内哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their favor extends beyond the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aurelia啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aurelia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 我真怕我再也见不到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I feared I would never hold you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我让Ashur送信给你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur said he found only blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.03,0:06:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 他只找到一滩血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I sent him to you with message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Titus回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Titus had returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没伤着你吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he hurt you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等着他被五马分尸的那一天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will see his heart from his fucking chest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那滩血不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood was not mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我狠狠地刺伤了他的下体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cut him, deep and low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他再也不能强奸妇女了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will never force himself on a woman again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我就跑到山上的哥哥家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afterwards I sought refuge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,避难去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my brother's family, in the hills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在斯巴达克斯的指示下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slave girl found me there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,女奴发现了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Spartacus' direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.80,0:07:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢天神 你平安无事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank the gods you're safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当Titus首次将魔爪伸向我的时候 天神在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were they when Titus first laid hands on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还怀着他的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still carry his child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没变 Varro\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothings changed, Varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个世界都变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire world has changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I along with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你孕育的 属于你的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It springs from your belly, a part of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想要他的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would love it as such…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会爱他如同己出\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you would have it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人发现了你的缺席\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your absence was noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,缺席…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absence…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.23,0:08:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来应该和我们在一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢面对窥视的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could not face prying eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要别人一看我的眼睛 他们就会了解一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}One look into mine and they would have full knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia的血…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia's blood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的头骨在我的掌中碎裂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her skull steeped between my fingers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你能不能清醒一点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter's cock, would you come to grips!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia的死 和你那档子事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia's murder and your part in it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,早被遮得严严实实\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been concealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.66,0:08:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相绝不会泄露\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth will only unfold if, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你自己失声说了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if your jaw splits and your tongue unfurls in song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you have me do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,做回你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appear yourself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事别玩什么良心谴责了\N{\fnArial\fs30}absent conscience of deeds unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官的庆典\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Magistrate's celebration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是一个良机\N{\fnArial\fs30}provides a perfect opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.43,0:08:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,庆典将在我家举行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The venue turns to my husband as host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至可以待着不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't even have to move from under this roof, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你重塑信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}my hand ever present to steady your resolve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我过这一关？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will guide me through this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是挚友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}As trusted friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为挚友 你也得回报我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as such, I require favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们联手让这次庆典\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would swell the ranks of celebration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为罗马贵族的盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}with these noble citizens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.43,0:09:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定贵族们会乐意接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ones I am certain would accept invite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Albinius元老院议员之女的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the daughter of Senator Albinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.60,0:09:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.93,0:09:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多大事等着你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,欠你的人情 我这一辈子也还不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you more than I can ever repay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.63,0:10:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没有派Mira去找我妻子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had not sent Mira to find my wife…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.53,0:10:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她回心转意了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has taken you back, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也成为不了那个配得上她的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will yet be the man she deserves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果成不了 我就天天在你耳边数落你的缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, I shall remind you of your shortcomings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 看见一个男人和妻子团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. It lifts the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真叫人激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see a man reunited with his woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你不必担心死的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you'll have someone to weep for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.33,0:10:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人为你哭坟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要死 也要死在竞技场上\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I fall, it will be in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为角斗士而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定还记得这种感觉 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember what that is like, do you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 Crixus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus, Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人传召你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are summoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我俩对阵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are to fight each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Numerius的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numerius has chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.86,0:10:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坚持要亲眼见证\N{\fnArial\fs30}He insisted on drinking in the spectacle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.60,0:10:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当今战神与过去战神的交锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}of present glories pitted against the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的愿望 当然应该得到满足 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his thirst shall be satisfied, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 这只是一次表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep to mind this is an exhibition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会有流血 但仅仅是为了助兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood may be spilled, but only for show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:11:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁胆敢一发而不可收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serious punishment will be meeted out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.03,0:11:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会严惩不贷\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the man who caused them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会为您争光的 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall serve you with honor, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect no less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.86,0:11:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,回住处去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to quarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 留一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus, remain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对Crixus怎么看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What make you of Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Numerius坚持要他上场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numerius insisted upon him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的伤口才刚刚愈合…\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet with his wounds barely sealed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为自己已经痊愈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believes himself ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,自欺欺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,自尊受到的打击 远胜于肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ego bruises deeper than the flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.80,0:11:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,前不久 他才给我们家族带来无上荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought this house great honor, not long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他太过尴尬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not overly embarrass the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.33,0:11:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给Numerius演场戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give Numerius a show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再无其它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当年穿上成人礼服的时候 正是在这间屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I put on the Toga Virilis, it was in this very room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,身边围满了我父亲的勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrounded by my father's champions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even then I knew{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有朝一日 我自己的勇士 将会令他们黯然失色\N{\fnArial\fs30}that one day my own Titans would eclipse them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spartacus 送雨的使者 这荣耀非你莫属\N{\fnArial\fs30}None more so than Spartacus, the Bringer of Rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:11:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.03,0:12:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我荣光无限\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honor me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也没你的功劳大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand above all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续保持这势头 我们将把世界尽收囊中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue on this path, and we will have the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.86,0:12:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grrrr!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在躲我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been avoiding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在做事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been tending my duties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.86,0:12:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这态度冷冰冰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your manner hardens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是喜欢你微笑的样子 前不久我们还相处甚欢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer it soft, as the moment we shared not so long ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误会我的笑容了 肢体碰触也是善意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mistake smile and friendly touch beyond intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 在你「善意」的碰触之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the key that went missing from my clasp, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那把不翼而飞的钥匙呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}after your "friendly" touch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.46,0:12:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不会是被你误拾了去吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did not by "mistake" draw into your palm, did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这问题让你这么紧张啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you tense from question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种反应让人有理由进行搜身…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such reaction warrants fair search…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只效忠于主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hands service Domina alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.13,0:13:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,未经允许 她不会乐意见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would not be pleased to have yours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被别人搜身\N{\fnArial\fs30}laid upon me without her consent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者知道有个守卫丢了钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to learn a guard has misplaced his key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让这事发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是因玩弄女人 而享负盛名啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have reputation for your handling of women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.90,0:13:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,到她们身上寻求慰藉去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seek your loss among them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用这种破理由来逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do not press me again with accusation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定Ilithyia在行政官面前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trust Ilithyia not to come unhinged…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会乱发疯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in front of the Magistrate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会死死盯住她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall keep watchful eyes upon her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿这次你能盯牢点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}More watchful than the last, I pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切对我们大为有利啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything worked to our advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia也欠我们债 这些债务结算下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia's in our debt, and through collection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.66,0:14:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自可铸就家族盛世\N{\fnArial\fs30}we gained access to the most noble of families.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她拟的名单？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She attends to the list?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她将为行政官的典礼 盛邀宾朋\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will draw all to the Magistrate's celebration, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧妙地引他们来我们这里作客\N{\fnArial\fs30}so artfully placed within our walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.03,0:14:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得有任何差错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be no cause for disappointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在斯巴达克斯和Crixus的表演赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the exhibition between Spartacus and Crixus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让行政官的儿子尽兴之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}has ignited his son, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会向行政官 提一下参政的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will broach the Magistrate on subject of political office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会得到同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be well received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius看到我 和卡普亚最上层人员互通往来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To behold Solonius' face when he sees me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.20,0:14:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,该是怎样一副嘴脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}consort with the highest echelon of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.96,0:14:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solonius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他如何目睹这一切？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well how should he witness such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会邀请他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}By invitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让他亲眼看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I desire his eyes upon me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官对我青眼有加\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I am anointed by the Magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让他看到我财运亨通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him to see that as my fortunes rise, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他却人财两空\N{\fnArial\fs30}his plummet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要往蛇的伤口上撒盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taunt an injured snake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这条蛇 随时可能反咬一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that may yet turn and strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ease your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候 我会让这条大蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The serpent's head will be struck from its body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,身首异处\N{\fnArial\fs30}in due course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 Solonius没机会反击的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, and Solonius will never see it coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 你和Crixus只是演戏 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you and Crixus battling as entertainment, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,演一场让那孩子永生难忘的戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something the boy will never forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是表演而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is only exhibition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人严令不可重伤对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus gave strict instructions to avoid grievous injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可别相信他会听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not believe he was listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的高卢角斗士已然康复了嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Gaul is restored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,康复的可不止他一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑夜过去 阳光普照 将使万物复苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun has revived what the night had withered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有赖于一位挚友的厚意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Due to kindness of a dear friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份厚意有回报了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is that kindness returned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官的典礼 将因名单上的人的参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Magistrate's celebration will swell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而大放光芒\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all names provided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会倾全力 为这事添砖加瓦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that I had words to multiply it in response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友的价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the value of a friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是用文字可以表达的\N{\fnArial\fs30}cannot be expressed by the clever grouping of letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:17:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这血肉之躯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is blood and flesh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,使世间彰显生机\N{\fnArial\fs30}granting life to the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你像个贱女一样服服帖帖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You submit like a fucking girl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.33,0:17:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着男人给你开苞呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}begging for a cock to split her open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我输了 你要我怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was bested. What would you have me do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.53,0:17:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起身来 一息尚存 战斗不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and fight till your final breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就说明 所谓「兄弟」之名只是虚假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or prove the name "brother" false.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说西西里岛处处有生机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard of opportunities in Sicilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我聪明点儿 我们早该逃去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had I been wise, we would have moved there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.43,0:17:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,甩掉一切债务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to escape my debts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而我妻子的忠告 却被我抛之脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the advice of my wife fell short of its mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人的话 要让男人听进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a distance to travel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是那么容易呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a woman's mouth to a man's ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此刻起 我会听她的话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall close the gap, from this point forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aurelia告诉我 西西里岛受神灵庇佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aurelia tells me Sicilia is an island blessed by the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.66,0:17:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你重获自由后 一定要到那里来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must visit us there, when you gain freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再奢望逃离此处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I no longer concern myself with thoughts beyond these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不该那样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nor should you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.23,0:18:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位真正的战神 应心系竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}A true champion dreams only of the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,倘若那人不再是战神 他又该心系何处呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what does one dream of when he's no longer champion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那窃取名号的小偷手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regaining the title from the thief{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺回头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}who stole it from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么也没偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stole nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是窃贼 全卡普亚民众都能作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I am a thief, the crime was witnessed by all of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我现今依然享负盛誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is still celebrated to this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.23,0:18:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人传唤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are summoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官明日\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Magistrate will arrive tomorrow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.13,0:18:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,将赶在其客人之前到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}well in advance of his guests, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,以确保一切筹备合乎标准\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ensure that preparations are to his standards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我让他满意后 那个孩子将交由你照料\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I reassure him, I would have you tend the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.30,0:18:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,务必迎合他的心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's imperative that he is well satisfied, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,并尽量满足他那尊贵的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by proximity his noble father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:19:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为Batiatus之名争光的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name Batiatus will be honored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让共和国上下为之眼红\N{\fnArial\fs30}And envied throughout the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一招棋很不明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}You move unwisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.86,0:19:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我玩过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had occasion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我尚在后备军服役\N{\fnArial\fs30}during my time with the auxiliary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管彰显你的博识吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}By all means, grace us with your knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 我们的战神不擅长玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears our champion has no head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,战略游戏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}for games of strategy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 一场战役的失败…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, battles maybe lost…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不能阻碍整场战争的胜利落幕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet the war concludes in victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！真他妈狡诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh! Treacherous fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个真正的罗马人一样战斗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Played like a true Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:20:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,腾出椅子来 去给我们拿些酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall from your chair. And bring us wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,叙利亚人做起生意来 能骗倒神鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Syrian could swindle the scales from a snake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.13,0:20:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不善攻术\N{\fnArial\fs30}but never command a charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们来进行男人之间的较量…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us have contest between men…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我想念你的抚摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, your touch has been missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.03,0:20:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的整个脑海为你占据\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thoughts of yours consume me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.96,0:20:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久 你就能感觉到战神的双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon you will feel the hands of a champion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.33,0:20:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次触碰你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}once again upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.00,0:20:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟斯巴达克斯的比赛只是场表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}The match with Spartacus is but exhibition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道观众们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the crowd as my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们渴望鲜血 我就给他们鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will yearn for blood, and I shall give it to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:20:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人不允许有人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus forbids injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.60,0:21:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,想取斯巴达克斯的命 你就必须得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make attempt on Spartacus' life is to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌上自己的命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to risk your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的命运啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是战神 那我什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not Champion, I am nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.76,0:21:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我要是去爱那个战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I must be without my mind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会把我逼疯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to love only the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.43,0:21:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我爱的 就是你的疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I relish your madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！真他妈要命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Fuck the heavens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么能战无不胜的啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you keep besting a man so far above your station?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.70,0:22:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生来 手里就握着利剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sprung from my mother with sword in hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.40,0:22:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗技能是我的第二天性\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ways of battle are second nature, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是家族的遗传\N{\fnArial\fs30}passed down from father to son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真遗憾我父亲没有看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret my own father never saw the advantage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,军事的荣耀之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}of military glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来都没发现 它能带来的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never saw the spoils that could be won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.70,0:22:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了资助人和盟约 他拿起了武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The patronage, the alliances forged had he taken up arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.43,0:22:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来没有过什么大的追求\N{\fnArial\fs30}He aspired to be no further than what he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.63,0:22:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是远离罗马城的一个 简单角斗士主而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple lanista, far from Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I, however.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.10,0:22:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经长上了翅膀 可以飞翔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have fashioned wings, to raise us higher{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.50,0:22:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不至于陷入先辈们那肮脏的泥潭里\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the muck and mire of heritage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,高飞到先辈们无法想象的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Higher than our fathers could never imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.23,0:23:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quintus啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quintus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.30,0:23:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么吵醒了夫人的美梦啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What stirs such a vision from her dreams?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的丈夫不在身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband not beside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯在陪我练棋呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus was helping me hone my game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.80,0:23:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还喝着小酒？… 哼嗯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over a cup of wine?… Hmm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.66,0:23:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的指导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for the instruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.76,0:23:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑子没病吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have your senses flown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.00,0:23:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然跟一个奴隶一起喝酒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To share drink with a slave…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.73,0:23:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在和卡普亚战神一起喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drink with the Champion of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.33,0:23:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus曾是战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus was Champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.33,0:23:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你从没想过和他喝杯酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet no cup was ever raised with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,咳啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.43,0:23:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus只是个蛮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus is a brute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.20,0:23:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可斯巴达克斯不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus is different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.20,0:23:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的好财运 可都是靠着他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe our good fortune to the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.66,0:23:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个下贱的奴隶啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's beneath you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.40,0:23:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们就要招待卡普亚的大官了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tomorrow we play host to Capua's finest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.43,0:23:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种行为会让人轻视的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such behavior would be spat upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.63,0:23:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不耻的只会是他们自己的阳具\N{\fnArial\fs30}They spit only to stroke their own cocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.13,0:23:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有斯巴达克斯 行政官才会恩宠我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus is the reason the Magistrate graces our house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.23,0:24:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才能拥有他带来的权势\N{\fnArial\fs30}along with all the shits that follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.40,0:24:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来看的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They come to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.93,0:24:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个平步青云的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man ascended to the heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.03,0:24:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而斯巴达克斯只不过是 你骑在胯下的野兽而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Spartacus is merely the beast that you ride upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.60,0:24:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟Varro像兄弟一样作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Varro fought as if brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.06,0:24:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的胜利无比荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your victory was a glorious sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.56,0:24:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到钥匙了吗 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see the key, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.93,0:24:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,装作好像什么都不知道的样子？啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't suppose you know anything about that? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.06,0:24:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.06,0:24:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still your tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.46,0:24:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女人惹到你什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What grievance has the woman given?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.53,0:24:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}None which concerns you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.83,0:24:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is known to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.66,0:24:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿的每个男人都认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is known to every cock in the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.96,0:24:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.13,0:24:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我她怎么惹你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me her grievance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下过命令了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.53,0:24:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.63,0:24:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,都他妈的在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the fucking meaning of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.70,0:24:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.53,0:24:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的守卫无缘无故殴打Mira\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man attacks Mira without cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.10,0:24:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么 胆敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What reason have you for laying hands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我的奴隶动手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}on one of my slaves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.43,0:24:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这女孩是个贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl is a thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.76,0:24:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没偷过！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.93,0:25:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你觉得她偷了什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly do you believe she has stolen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值钱的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.43,0:25:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.73,0:25:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得太过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You overstep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.46,0:25:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这月的工钱 别拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A month's wages, forfeited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.10,0:25:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是敢再犯 就不只是扣扣小钱而已了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press further and coin will be replaced by blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.03,0:25:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.26,0:25:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.73,0:25:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.80,0:25:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别他妈的废话！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not fucking speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.50,0:25:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚在妻子面前帮你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I defend your worth to my wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.90,0:25:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就在我的房子里搞这些个玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to turn and find you shitting in my fucking house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.36,0:25:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果成年礼不是在明天的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Toga Virilis were not tomorrow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.73,0:25:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早用鞭子把你揍得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have you lashed until the flesh peeled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.16,0:25:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮开肉绽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}from your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.06,0:25:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,再敢跟我的警卫动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay hands on one of my guards again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.56,0:25:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会更惨不忍睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will receive far worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.76,0:25:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.43,0:26:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打了一个守卫 却没被罚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You attack a guard yet escape punishment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.56,0:26:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,战神名号可不是用来看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being Champion is not without advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.66,0:26:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我以后得紧紧跟在你后面了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must remember to stay close to your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.26,0:26:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你的好运会分点到我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps a swath of your good fortune will rub off upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.86,0:26:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你多花些力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your efforts would be better focused{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.36,0:26:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护你的侧面就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}protecting your flank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.26,0:26:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.26,0:26:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calavius行政官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magistrate Calavius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.13,0:26:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus家欢迎您的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The House of Batiatus welcomes you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.73,0:26:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是蓬荜生辉啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}on this glorious day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.16,0:26:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的男孩走进来 出门就变成男子汉了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young boy enters my doors, but leaves a man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.76,0:26:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for your hospitalities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.00,0:26:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会铭记于心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in your debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.30,0:26:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As are we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.80,0:26:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.06,0:26:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心你的健康啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd begun to fear for your health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.33,0:26:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小小问题而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}A momentary lapse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.90,0:26:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可真是受到了无微不至的关怀啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been tended to with most compassionate care{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.70,0:26:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}within these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.73,0:26:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,角斗士们呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the gladiators?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.06,0:26:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Numerius啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numerius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.93,0:26:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他昨晚因为过度兴奋而无法入睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't sleep last night, for excitement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.66,0:26:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能为此责怪他呢？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can blame him?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.73,0:26:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在共和国最伟大的巨人们中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}To stand among the greatest titans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.56,0:27:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都将遵从你的号令\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Republic, his to command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.46,0:27:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine? Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.30,0:27:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我授命每一位光荣的勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each of my proud warriors has been instructed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.46,0:27:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,都遵从你的号令 如同遵从我一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}to regard your orders as if from my own lips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.96,0:27:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Flavius肯定会嫉妒死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flavius will be filled with great envy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.00,0:27:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,活该他嫉妒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}As he should!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他听闻卡普亚战神 亲自带你参观训练场的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even more so when he hears the Champion of Capua himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.66,0:27:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不知会嫉妒到哪里去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}has given you a tour of the ludus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.33,0:27:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.76,0:27:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正等待你的驾临 在你父亲的许可之下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He awaits your presence, with permission of your father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.53,0:27:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,统治这些阿波罗战马般的勇士 我将更有财运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have better fortune reigning Apollo's horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.06,0:27:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫！护送年轻的Numerius\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards! Escort young Numerius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.00,0:27:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到训练场\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the training square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.70,0:27:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见过他如此兴致昂扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen him in higher spirits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.33,0:27:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus家的别墅的确拥有这样的魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house of Batiatus has such an effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.56,0:27:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾站在他们的阳台眺望过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever witnessed a view from their balcony?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.13,0:27:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的景色将彻底征服你的感官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It simply overwhelms the senses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.43,0:27:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.56,0:27:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去注视卡普亚的完美艺术品吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us gaze upon Capua's perfection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.53,0:27:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也给两个大男人一些私人时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And give the men private moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.96,0:27:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,探讨彼此的女人 如何风骚迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to discuss how ravishing their women are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.56,0:27:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia住在你这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia resides with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.16,0:27:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.33,0:27:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们重要的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A valued friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.23,0:28:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲与丈夫均与元老院关系匪浅\N{\fnArial\fs30}With connection to the senate in both husband and father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.60,0:28:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实价值重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Value indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.13,0:28:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个人 都必须非常小心得挑选伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}One must choose one's company with exceeding care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.10,0:28:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 就等着被拖后腿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or else be dragged down by them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.86,0:28:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切准备妥当了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preparations are in order?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.50,0:28:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已将这孩子视如己出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set as if the boy was my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.63,0:28:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,无须多虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erase all concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.00,0:28:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,今夜 将让所有出席者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This night will be etched in the memories of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.43,0:28:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,此生铭记\N{\fnArial\fs30}all in attendance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.06,0:28:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这该是怎样的感觉 在你的手心\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it like, having the life of another{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.73,0:28:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,攥着另一个生命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}resting in your hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.86,0:28:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我兴许能一剑 终结他的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sword may deliver the final blow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.43,0:28:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一名角斗士的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a gladiator's fate is for the crowd{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.46,0:28:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要由观众和主人所决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the editor to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.46,0:28:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这悬崖处没有墙啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no wall over by the cliff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.43,0:28:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是因为这一点 我才觉得最好不要在此地训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very reason I find it best not to train there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.50,0:28:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人曾掉下悬崖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone ever fallen below?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.86,0:28:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾亲眼目睹过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've witnessed but one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.53,0:28:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.80,0:28:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次一别 我们已经很久没有训练了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time since last we trained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.83,0:28:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你还记得多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see what you remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.76,0:29:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官的儿子让我们的战地遍洒荣光…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Magistrate's son graces our sands…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.63,0:29:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们就这样迎接他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is what greets him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.90,0:29:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了配得上他的兴致 我需要一名对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that I had an opponent worthy of his interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.46,0:29:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来和你比试比试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would spar with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.46,0:29:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是真正的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant a real gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.36,0:29:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus的表现完美无瑕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus shows impeccable form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.66,0:29:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 今晚我会在你的庆典上另行证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, I shall prove otherwise at your ceremony tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.63,0:29:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人敢来挑战吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else dare challenge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.40,0:29:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的战斗 还没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fight is not yet finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.50,0:29:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,退出吧 小畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down, pup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我把你阳痿的老二打到小便失禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before your shriveling cock wets the sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.80,0:30:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被击败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man is beaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.23,0:30:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉体上 也许是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In body, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.66,0:30:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但武力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet confrontation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.96,0:30:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,往往不能解决争斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is often not won by force, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.13,0:30:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}by will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.13,0:30:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持下去 你这蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down, you ignorant shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.60,0:31:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.70,0:31:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个男人已被彻底击败 却被当成胜利者对待？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man is soundly defeated, yet treated as victor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.80,0:31:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种尊敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sign of respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.36,0:31:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的勇气值得钦佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}For his courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,送他去看医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}See him to the medicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.90,0:31:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everyday like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.33,0:32:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was unaware you possessed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.33,0:32:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对战棋很有两把刷子\N{\fnArial\fs30}such a skilled hand at Latrunculi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.80,0:32:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在军事战略方面 我仍将自己看做一名学徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I consider myself a student of military strategy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.80,0:32:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了获胜 必须设计 出其不意地捕获对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}To win, one must maneuver to catch ones opponent unawares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.03,0:32:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,战场上如此 政治上亦如是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it is in war, so it is in politics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.83,0:32:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 又一个令我感兴趣的主题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm, another subject of my interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.56,0:32:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.73,0:32:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.76,0:32:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯将他的剑给了我 我可以训练了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus gave me his sword, so I could practice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.96,0:32:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Numerius 你身上太脏了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numerius, you are filthy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.73,0:32:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不去洗洗的话 就要结成硬壳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear he will form a crust if not sent to water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.03,0:32:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他没有梳洗完毕前\N{\fnArial\fs30}No we shall see him well prepared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.26,0:32:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不能出来见客了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the guests arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.13,0:32:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Naevia 护送Numerius去浴池\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia, escort Numerius to the bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.73,0:32:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.56,0:32:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.63,0:32:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走过这里就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just through here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.90,0:32:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是太过于孩子气\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is yet much the boy in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.20,0:32:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,最多再有一会儿罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For but a moment longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.63,0:32:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,今夜Numerius将蜕变为男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight Numerius becomes a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.40,0:33:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗干净了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.30,0:33:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你还想再好好擦一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you yet require a hard scrubbing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.60,0:33:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I am…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.43,0:33:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.40,0:33:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.56,0:33:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么能比温暖的洗浴更令人舒适的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more sensual than a warm bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.86,0:33:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,水流爱抚着你的肌肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, the water caressing your skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.96,0:33:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的双眼… 直勾勾地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes seem rather… fixed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.06,0:33:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.10,0:33:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,无需抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}None required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.43,0:33:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今夜由你主宰 Numerius\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your night, Numerius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.70,0:33:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在男人的一生中 有且仅有一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that occurs but once in a man's lifetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.33,0:33:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心中充满了兴奋和刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am filled with much excitement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.16,0:33:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,理所当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.90,0:33:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人生之卷 正在你面前展开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life unfolds before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.36,0:33:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,数不清的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many glories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.60,0:33:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,数不清的光环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many honors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.23,0:33:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,数不清的乐事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many pleasures…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.66,0:33:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今夜做出的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The choices you make tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.53,0:33:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,将随着时光的流逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}will ripple through time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.60,0:34:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变你的宿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}altering fates and destinies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.86,0:34:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有这一切 都由你掌控\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much rests in your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.86,0:34:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我会妥善填满 你想要的一切…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would see them properly filled…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.85,0:35:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.88,0:35:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而后他跳起 像这样捅了他一刀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he'd jump up and stab him down like that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.08,0:35:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.41,0:35:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他堵住了退路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd block that back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.55,0:35:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一场不错的庆典啊 Batiatus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fine celebration, Batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.11,0:35:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见他如此开怀过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen the boy so happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.28,0:35:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别再叫他小男孩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us call him boy no longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.95,0:35:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来不更像一个大男人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, does he not appear to you a man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.55,0:35:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像高了很多 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does seem to stand taller, does he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.28,0:35:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,身板挺大块的\N{\fnArial\fs30}By quite some measure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.88,0:35:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 他的身形将直追他伟大的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon he will rival the stature of his honored father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.45,0:35:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是让我无比自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gives great pride, to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.01,0:35:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道Calavius家族后继有人 大道有望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have such an heir to carry the name Calavius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.48,0:35:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个家庭 都该得到这样的祝福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every house should be so blessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.55,0:35:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 你的儿子将会大展宏图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe your son will do extraordinary things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.91,0:35:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经迫不及待想要看到那一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I for one cannot wait to see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.05,0:35:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一下 来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a go, come on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.98,0:35:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 副将的老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears the wife of the Legatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.58,0:35:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然心怀怨恨啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet harbors grudge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.71,0:36:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不过是只被砍了爪子的猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a cat absent claws.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.48,0:36:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有尖牙尚存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet fangs remain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.65,0:36:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你昨晚的英勇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.98,0:36:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他越界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man overstepped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.25,0:36:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是纠正了他的错行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I merely made correction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.15,0:36:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管如此 你的心里仍然充满了友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, the heart swells at such kindness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.35,0:36:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就看着它消失殆尽吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then see it deflate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.35,0:36:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对任何一个女人都会这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have done the same for any woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.81,0:36:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are an ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.18,0:36:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 卡普亚战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the Champion of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.68,0:36:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是朋友满天下啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always making friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.21,0:36:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need but one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.58,0:36:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.85,0:36:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你也就这一个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since it appears one is all you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.75,0:36:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她丈夫正心急如焚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her husband is mad with worry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.31,0:36:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia彻底失踪了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia has completely vanished!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.21,0:36:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在夜色中悄然离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}She slipped away in the night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.51,0:36:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有奴隶相随 再也没人见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}absent slaves and not seen since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.28,0:36:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位正派的女人 绝不该无人护送 只身外出\N{\fnArial\fs30}A proper woman should never travel without escort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.91,0:36:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的表亲Crassus 已重金悬赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her cousin good Crassus has offered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.51,0:37:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,期望能够找到她的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}substantial reward for her discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.18,0:37:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是她有所损伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larger still towards punishment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.35,0:37:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,惩罚也将极其严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}if harms been done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.75,0:37:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁敢对Crassus的亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who would wish such a thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.81,0:37:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,做这种事呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon a relation of Crassus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.28,0:37:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why that would be madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.01,0:37:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也揭示了 被逼到绝境之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is revelation what we are capable of, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.61,0:37:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所作所为会出人意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}when pushed to brink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.78,0:37:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是被拖入绝境之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or pulled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.78,0:37:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有丈夫和奴隶相随\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there can only be one cause{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.58,0:37:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜晚独自开溜\N{\fnArial\fs30}to slip out in the night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.61,0:37:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能有一种解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}absent slaves or husbands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.41,0:37:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.48,0:37:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她嫁给了一个又矮又胖的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is married to a fat little man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.28,0:37:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅有的几根头发也是杂乱不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}who sprouts hair as if beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.61,0:37:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能忍心责怪她呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who could blame her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.51,0:37:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫不及待投入他人怀抱 如同海伦投怀于帕里斯一般！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flown to the arms of another, as Helen to Paris!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.51,0:37:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.11,0:37:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕今夜罗马将黯然失色…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear Rome must be absent her beauty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.75,0:37:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在卡普亚 共和国的珍珠\N{\fnArial\fs30}for tonight the jewels of the Republic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.55,0:37:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在我的面前熠熠生辉\N{\fnArial\fs30}stand glittering before me in Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.21,0:37:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的Solonius\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.45,0:37:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是决定出席了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You decided to attend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.78,0:37:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能抗拒如此神圣的伙伴呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who could resist such divine company?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.31,0:37:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有眼花吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do my eyes deceive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.71,0:37:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius 你终于肯现身了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solonius, come from the shadow to the light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.88,0:37:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一个兄弟般的拥抱吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embrace me as brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.21,0:37:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿血脉将我们紧紧相连\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that blood were our bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.08,0:38:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点认不出你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost did not recognize you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.41,0:38:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,脸色太憔悴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so gaunt of cheek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.45,0:38:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you quite well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.05,0:38:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身体好得不能再好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My health has never been better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.71,0:38:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲剧啊 你在竞技场的财运 却与之南辕北辙 哈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly the same can't be said for your fortunes in the arena, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.01,0:38:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有幸和行政官见过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you had opportunity to greet the Magistrate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.05,0:38:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来时 他正忙着和Consularis开会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was deep in conference with the Consularis when I arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.78,0:38:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在你穿了晚礼服的份上 我相信他一定会抽时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the evening wears, I am certain he will find time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.11,0:38:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你这样不甚重要的客人会面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the less significant guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.81,0:38:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for the invitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.35,0:38:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望很快 能有幸邀请您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope soon to return the favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.01,0:38:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他那张脸上的表情吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see the look upon his face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.85,0:38:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他如垂死一般龇牙咧嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the rictus of a man dying, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.45,0:38:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,被狠狠地刺了一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}a slice at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.58,0:38:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更希望给他绝命一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have the fatal cut in a single stroke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.15,0:38:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我喜欢尽可能多的打击他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I prefer as many strokes as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.61,0:38:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让快乐最大化\N{\fnArial\fs30}To maximize the pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.51,0:38:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然没发现 你喜欢异乡情调\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was unaware you had taste for such exotic treats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.01,0:39:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起 不能被别人看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot be seen together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.91,0:39:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得Batiatus邀请我参加 很是奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find it curious that Batiatus would extend me invitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.38,0:39:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在计划什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he planning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.31,0:39:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在行政官面前羞辱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To humiliate you before the Magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.18,0:39:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你主人是在玩火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your master swims in deep waters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.51,0:39:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不了多久 就得玩火自焚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some day soon he shall disappear beneath the waves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.11,0:39:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！请移步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come! Gather, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.61,0:39:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊敬的贵宾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}esteemed guests!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.88,0:39:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,名门望族的客人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those of questionable repute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.01,0:39:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 Batiatus家族 不胜荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight the House of Batiatus is humbled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.65,0:39:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以举行一场最荣耀的盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help celebrate a most glorious occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.41,0:39:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官Calavius之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The son of Magistrate Calavius, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.01,0:39:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,将褪下孩童之袍\N{\fnArial\fs30}casts off the robes of a boy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.88,0:39:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,行罗马成人之礼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and becomes a proper Roman man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.05,0:39:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他穿上成年礼服之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet before he dons the Toga Virilis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.78,0:39:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们用竞技和鲜血为其致敬吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}let us honor him with sport and blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.61,0:39:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,前战神与现战神的交锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}A contest between the present and the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.78,0:40:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 卡普亚战神！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus, Champion of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.01,0:40:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,走上前来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step forward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.68,0:40:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有Crixus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.81,0:40:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,前战神 走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Former Champion, step…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.11,0:40:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.61,0:40:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心Crixus的昔日辉煌 早已不再\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear Crixus has seen his best day past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.85,0:40:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让Varro代替他出战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have Varro fight in his place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.95,0:40:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,您是决策者 年轻的主人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the editor, young master!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.68,0:40:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人所愿 我之所行！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your will, our hands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.81,0:40:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro！走上前来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro! Step forward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.21,0:40:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道会与我对战吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have hand in my elevation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.68,0:40:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,男孩的心思 瞬息万变\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy's change comes as surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.61,0:40:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来 天神现在眷顾的是我们俩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems the gods favor us both now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.78,0:40:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,向男孩致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.78,0:40:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为训练场添光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor the ludus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.08,0:41:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Numerius在我们自己家里侮辱Crixus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numerius insults Crixus in our own house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.21,0:41:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,先不管它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.78,0:41:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官的欢心才是我们的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Magistrate's happiness is our only concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.38,0:41:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Numerius 来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come Numerius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.55,0:41:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些男人 竞技场的巨人 都在等候你的号令！\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men, these titans of the arena, await your command!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.61,0:41:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们展示一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us give them a show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.88,0:41:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.21,0:41:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.21,0:42:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的侧面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fucking flank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.75,0:42:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护好 下次胜利的可能就是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect it, and next time it may be you who stands victorious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.61,0:42:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 依旧是卡普亚的战神！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus, still the Champion of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.75,0:42:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而Varro 是强大的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Varro, formidable opponent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.25,0:42:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要密切关注的竞技场人物！\N{\fnArial\fs30}one to watch closely in the arena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.71,0:42:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请Numerius！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come Numerius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.95,0:42:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,请决定战败斗士的生死吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass judgment on our fallen warrior!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.38,0:43:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 行政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, Magistrate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.51,0:43:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说好了 这只是一场展示赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was agreed this was an exhibition only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.91,0:43:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是生死决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a fight to the death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.11,0:43:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.28,0:43:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Numerius已经做了决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numerius has made his decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.18,0:43:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会赔偿你的损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will reimburse you the cost of the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.41,0:43:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.71,0:43:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗 Batiatus？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have a problem, Batiatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.01,0:44:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.45,0:44:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.38,0:44:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.28,0:44:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀死我们俩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will kill us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.61,0:44:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没得选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.28,0:44:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择一直都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is always a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.71,0:44:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.25,0:44:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.71,0:45:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.88,0:45:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see my family provided for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.95,0:45:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.71,0:45:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会这么做的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have done the same…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.71,0:46:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的款待 我将永远铭记于心 Batiatus\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am forever indebted to your hospitality, Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.35,0:46:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,您不必放在心上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think nothing of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.35,0:46:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为朋友 在所不辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}A favor for a dear friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.75,0:46:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他判定生死 毫不迟疑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He calls for blood without hesitation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.68,0:46:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的大胆 终会让他跻身元老院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such boldness will one day lead him to the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.31,0:46:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,高贵的野心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The noblest of ambitions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.31,0:46:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己对行政官职也有所希冀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I myself have designs towards political office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.58,0:46:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.91,0:46:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不是元老院 也不会这么早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not the senate, not so soon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.05,0:46:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是当地的职位\N{\fnArial\fs30}but something local.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.31,0:47:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望得到您的支持 也许明天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would speak to you of support, perhaps tomorrow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.61,0:47:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为公事 我要动身到海岸去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave for the coast on business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.95,0:47:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就等您回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you return then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.71,0:47:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,政治对你这样擅于游说的人来说 太无趣了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Politics is too dull for a man of your persuasion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.98,0:47:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会想念竞技场的呼声和风采\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would ache for the sights and sounds of the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.01,0:47:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了服务罗马 我很乐意牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sacrifice I would gladly make in the service to Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.45,0:47:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus 你是个优秀的角斗士主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus, you are a fine lanista.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.98,0:47:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是全共和国最优秀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the finest in all the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.31,0:47:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是政治嘛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But politics…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.08,0:47:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要其他的品质\N{\fnArial\fs30}It requires a different sort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.28,0:47:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,身份地位 还有适当的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Citizens of status, with the proper heritage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.35,0:47:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.55,0:47:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽情享受你在行的东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relish what you know best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.55,0:47:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,把政治留给那些为此而生的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave politics to the men with breeding for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.05,0:47:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 Solonius！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, good Solonius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.48,0:47:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚还没好好说过话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have not had occasion to speak this evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.25,0:47:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官反应如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Magistrate's response?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.98,0:47:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺得我鲜血淋漓\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be answered in blood.{\r}
